{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.UnifiedCurvatureRankMassFormula","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.UnifiedCurvatureRankMassFormula","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.paper_terminology_mapping","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.paper_terminology_mapping","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L96-L119","doc":"**Corollary (paper terminology mapping).**\nThe historical \"six terms + Term 7\" decomposes uniformly:\n  Term j = α_{k(j)} · Φ_{k(j)}  for j ∈ {1, 2, 3}\n  Term 4 = universal (sum over all k weighted by 1/dim_q)\n  Term 5 = S-anti-invariant component of Σ_{k≥2} Φ_k\n  Term 6 = α_3 · Φ_3\n  Term 7 = Σ_{k≥4} α_k · Φ_k\n","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.term_6_plus_term_7_eq_high_strata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.term_6_plus_term_7_eq_high_strata","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L76-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.foldl_add_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.foldl_add_eq","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L59-L74","doc":"**Theorem (Term 6 + Term 7 = sum over depths ≥ 3).**\nWith prefactor sequence `alphas` defined by paper's Term-6 and\nTerm-7 conventions, the legacy \"Term 6 + Term 7\" combination\nequals the partial sum Σ_{k=3}^{n-1} α_k · Φ_k.\n\nPure list algebra. This was an axiom\n(`term_6_plus_term_7_eq_high_strata_axiom`) \"pending the exact lemma\nforms\"; proved 2026-11-15 from `foldl_add_eq` by induction on `n`.\nIt holds for `3 ≤ n`; the old `4 ≤ n` hypothesis is kept for callers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.unified_curvature_rank_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.unified_curvature_rank_mass","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L46-L49","doc":"The unified mass formula: sum over curvature-rank strata. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula","label":"prop:unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.Phi_at_depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.Phi_at_depth","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L41-L44","doc":"The k-th curvature-rank log functional. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.character_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.character_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L39-L39","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.weight_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.weight_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.character","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.character","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.weight","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.depth","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock.mk","kind":"ctor","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.WedderburnMass.StratumBlock","kind":"structure","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/unified-curvature-rank-mass-formula.lean#L33-L39","doc":"Abstract data: (depth, weight, character). ","signatureChunk":0}]}